# Used by the CloudFoundry Multi-Buildpack when the manifest
# `buildpack: https://github.com/cloudfoundry/multi-buildpack.git` is set.
# Each buildpack is applied in order, supplying both runtimes.
# Pin revisions for reproducibility, e.g.:
#   https://github.com/cloudfoundry/python-buildpack.git
#   https://github.com/cloudfoundry/nodejs-buildpack.git
https://github.com/cloudfoundry/python-buildpack.git
https://github.com/cloudfoundry/nodejs-buildpack.git